// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`render (markdown) > has a table, the details and the footer 1`] = `
"## sdkbump: App (React Native)

**Fails to launch when built with the iOS 27 SDK.**

- Target \`App\`: app delegate life cycle (\`App/Info.plist\`)
- \`react-native\` 0.87.1 (declared)

| Rule | Severity | Where | Finding |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| SCN001 | error | \`App/Info.plist\` | No scene configuration |
| SCN002 | error | \`App/AppDelegate.swift:12\` | Window created in the app delegate |
| SCN003 | warning (handled by react-native-uiscene-bridge) | \`App/AppDelegate.swift:30\` | application(_:open:options:) is not called with scenes |

<details><summary>What each finding means and how to fix it</summary>

### SCN001: No scene configuration

\`App/Info.plist\`: Info.plist has no UIApplicationSceneManifest.

**Fix: Adopt a scene delegate** ([guide](https://github.com/muhittincamdali/sdkbump/blob/main/docs/guides/adopt.md))

1. Step one of Adopt a scene delegate.
2. Step two, which is long enough to be wrapped onto a second line of the report.

**Or: Temporary: install a bridge** ([guide](https://github.com/muhittincamdali/sdkbump/blob/main/docs/guides/bridge.md))

1. Step one of Temporary: install a bridge.
2. Step two, which is long enough to be wrapped onto a second line of the report.

Sources: [Apple: Transitioning](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/uikit)

### SCN002: Window created in the app delegate

\`App/AppDelegate.swift:12\`: AppDelegate creates the window with UIWindow(frame:).

**Fix: Adopt a scene delegate** (steps above)

Sources: [Apple: Transitioning](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/uikit)

### SCN003: application(_:open:options:) is not called with scenes

\`App/AppDelegate.swift:30\`: Info.plist has no UIApplicationSceneManifest.

Handled at run time by \`react-native-uiscene-bridge\` 0.1.0. Adds a scene configuration at run time. Limits: One window.

**Fix: Move it to the scene delegate** ([guide](https://github.com/muhittincamdali/sdkbump/blob/main/docs/guides/move.md))

1. Step one of Move it to the scene delegate.
2. Step two, which is long enough to be wrapped onto a second line of the report.

Sources: [Apple: Transitioning](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/uikit)

</details>

2 errors, 0 warnings, 1 handled by a workaround. Guide: [React Native](https://github.com/muhittincamdali/sdkbump/blob/main/docs/guides/react-native-expo.md).

<sub>[sdkbump](https://github.com/muhittincamdali/sdkbump) 0.1.0, rules ios27@2026.10.15 (iOS 27.0 SDK). Static checks; they do not build or run the app.</sub>
"
`;

